    axes: { harm: 1, pitch: 1, ornament: 2, meter: 1, density: 1, transmission: 1, improv: 1, soundTech: 1, intensity: 2, voice: 2, timbre: 1, percussion: 2, cyclicity: 1 },
    description: 'German-language hip-hop tradition emerging in 1990s through Die Fantastischen Vier (Stuttgart), Advanced Chemistry (Heidelberg), and the broader Frankfurt scene. The 2000s second-wave through Bushido, Sido, Aggro Berlin label, and Kool Savas extended the genre commercially; the 2010s-2020s wave through Capital Bra, Bonez MC, Apache 207, and the broader trap-and-drill influenced sound brought deutschrap to streaming dominance in German-speaking countries.',
    exemplars: ['Die Fantastischen Vier', 'Bushido', 'Sido', 'Kool Savas', 'Capital Bra', 'Bonez MC', 'Apache 207'],
    status: 'documented',
    crossRefs: ['mcRhythm.usHipHop'],
