    description: 'Mid-1990s UK electronic subgenre developed from hardcore breakbeat through faster-tempo (160-180 BPM) characterized by uplifting-and-bright synth-melodic-lead designs, sped-up female-vocal-sample hooks, and explicit rave-functional dance-floor-targeting. Slipmatt, Hixxy, Sharkey, Force & Styles, and the broader Bonkers compilation series anchor the canonical roster.',
