    description: '2010s American-and-international pop subgenre integrating European-dance-music production-aesthetic with American pop-vocal-feature mainstream commercial framework. Lady Gaga\'s The Fame (2008-2009 launch), Ke$ha\'s Animal (2010), Katy Perry\'s Teenage Dream (2010), and the broader Max Martin, RedOne, Dr. Luke, and Ryan Tedder producer-network consolidated the canonical 2010s dance-pop production aesthetic. Distinguished by EDM-festival-aesthetic absorption into pop chart-mainstream.',
