  "christian_alternative_rock": {"parent":"distortedRock.alternative","axes":{"harm":0,"pitch":1,"ornament":0,"meter":1,"density":1,"transmission":0,"improv":0,"soundTech":1,"intensity":1,"voice":1,"timbre":1,"percussion":1,"cyclicity":1},"description":"The selected model lets a solid bass/drum foundation carry ornamental guitar figures and distinct electric-piano/workstation colors beneath lead singing. Delay and light overdrive are studio-production choices grounded in the documented palette. Christian association is a repertoire/audience relationship rather than a special instrument construction; the broader cluster also includes heavier and worship-oriented artists.","exemplars":["Switchfoot — Vice Verses","Switchfoot — Hello Hurricane","Relient K","Jars of Clay"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
