  "instrumental_funk": {"parent":"groovePercussion.funkPercussive","axes":{"harm":-1,"pitch":-1,"ornament":0,"meter":0,"density":1,"transmission":0,"improv":1,"soundTech":1,"intensity":1,"voice":-2,"timbre":0,"percussion":2,"cyclicity":2},"description":"Instrumental funk places interlocking bass, drums and recurring horn or guitar figures at the center without a lead singer. The selected Budos Band branch combines syncopated percussion, horn riffs and organ with Afro-soul and psychedelic influences. This is a newly authored studio arrangement, not a reconstruction of the exemplar session.","exemplars":["The Budos Band — Long in the Tooth (2020)"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
