  "progressive_black_metal": {"parent":"distortedRock.metal.black","axes":{"harm":1,"pitch":-1,"ornament":1,"meter":0,"density":2,"transmission":0,"improv":0,"soundTech":2,"intensity":2,"voice":1,"timbre":2,"percussion":2,"cyclicity":0},"description":"Electric-guitar figures and bass move through contrasting heavy and spacious sections, supported by active drum kit, keyboard layers and voice. The artist’s history explicitly places its black/progressive sound and Heimdal in this continuum. A modern workstation realizes the documented keyboard role without claiming a historical model. E-flat guitar tuning, tremolo option and all recording parameters are authored, and the setting need not remain at blast-beat intensity throughout.","exemplars":["Enslaved — Heimdal"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":["distortedRock.metal.prog"]},
