  "chinese_manyao": {"parent":"electronicDance","axes":{"harm":0,"pitch":0,"ornament":0,"meter":0,"density":-1,"transmission":0,"improv":0,"soundTech":0,"intensity":0,"voice":-2,"timbre":0,"percussion":-1,"cyclicity":0},"description":"Official artist channel publishes a complete explicitly titled Mandarin Chinese Remix Manyao Mix, mixed by ReyLimitless at145BPM, with thirteen-track listing. The entire program is selected as actual positive DJ mixing practice. No constituent master is reduced to invented sampler-only production. Its record layers and embedded voices remain inside the documented playback/mixing resource; number of original or live singers unknown. Creator exact ChineseManyao map confirms the named discovery category; independent performer explicitly names Mandarin Chinese Remix Manyao in the whole program title. This language/repertoire remix practice overlaps Chinese pop and electronic music without equating the whole national electronic scene to remix DJ programs. The selected edition explicitly uses breakbeat at145BPM; no universal manyao tempo or beat structure inferred. The category boundary is Chinese-song remix/dance-program practice, not DJ nationality or new artist alone. Hardware, playback medium, individual synthesis/sample engines and microphones unknown. Existing neutral DJ playback/mixing owner preserves the source role. No global tuning imposed. Room, chain and neutral axes authored. Representative authored present-day recording arrangement for the selected documented branch. Sources establish category, roles and locality. Exact materials, makes, playing settings, tuning, room, signal chain and axes are authored choices, not measured source-session facts or universal genre characteristics.","exemplars":["ReyLimitless — complete DJ Tiao Lou Ji Breakbeat Mandarin Chinese Remix Manyao Mix, July2025"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
